+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+## Voyage: TodoMVC build — Specs and watchbill authored
+
+Spec source: `assets/app-spec.md`
+Template source: `assets/app-template.index.html`
+Implementation: Vanilla JavaScript, no preprocessors, localStorage persistence.
+Verification tier: happy-dom (already rigged — world.js exists, tier default @logic).
+
+### Specs authored covering all app-spec.md behaviours
+
+- `features/todo-management.feature` — new todo, no-todos visibility, counter, whitespace trim, empty guard
+- `features/todo-completion.feature` — toggle single, mark all, clear completed, toggle-all sync
+- `features/todo-editing.feature` — double-click edit, save on Enter/blur, cancel on Escape, empty destroys
+- `features/routing.feature` — #/, #/active, #/completed routes, selected class, live filter on state change
+- `features/persistence.feature` — localStorage save/restore, completion persistence, no editing state persisted
+
+### watchbill.json
+
+24 scenario targets across 5 watches. Ordered: display -> completion -> editing -> routing -> persistence.
+
+### Next
+
+Dispatch QM on `main` with the watchbill. Context MUST clear before QM.
+
+### Open questions
+
+- `todos-[framework]` key format per spec: using `todos-todomvc-shakedown` given package name. Confirm or override before persistence spec passes.
