+++ b/features/persistence.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+Feature: Persistence
+  As a user of the todo app
+  I want my todos to be saved across page reloads
+  So that I do not lose my task list
+
+  Scenario: Todos are persisted to localStorage
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    When I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    Then localStorage has a key matching "todos-"
+    And the stored value contains 2 items
+    And each stored item has an id, title, and completed property
+    And editing state is not persisted
+
+  Scenario: Todos are restored from localStorage on load
+    Given localStorage has 2 persisted todos
+    When the app loads
+    Then the todo list shows 2 items
+    And the todo count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Completion state is persisted
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    When I mark the first todo as completed
+    And I reload the app
+    Then the first todo item has the completed class on its parent li
