new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ead6452
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/routing.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@
+Feature: Routing and filtering
+  As a user of the todo app
+  I want to filter the todo list by completion state
+  So that I can focus on active or completed items
+
+  Scenario: Default route shows all todos
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    And I mark the first todo as completed
+    When the route is "#/"
+    Then the todo list shows 2 items
+    And the "All" filter link has the selected class
+    And the "Active" filter link does not have the selected class
+    And the "Completed" filter link does not have the selected class
+
+  Scenario: Active route shows only active todos
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    And I mark the first todo as completed
+    When the route is "#/active"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item with the title "Walk the dog"
+
+  Scenario: Completed route shows only completed todos
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    And I mark the first todo as completed
+    When the route is "#/completed"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item with the title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Selected filter class toggles with route change
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    When the route is "#/active"
+    Then the "Active" filter link has the selected class
+    When the route is "#/completed"
+    Then the "Completed" filter link has the selected class
+    When the route is "#/"
+    Then the "All" filter link has the selected class
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo in a filtered view hides it
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    When the route is "#/active"
+    And I mark the first visible todo as completed
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item with the title "Walk the dog"
