@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@
+Feature: Todo completion
+  As a user of the todo app
+  I want to mark todos as complete and clear completed items
+  So that I can track my progress
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a single todo as complete
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for the todo
+    Then the todo item has the completed class on its parent li
+    And the toggle checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Mark all todos as complete
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then every todo item has the completed class on its parent li
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no completed todos
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button removes completed todos
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    And I mark the first todo as completed
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item with the title "Walk the dog"
+    And the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all reflects individual completion state
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    When I mark every todo as completed
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+    When I unmark one todo
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
