+Feature: Todo management
+  As a user of the todo app
+  I want to create and view todos
+  So that I can keep track of things I need to do
+
+  Scenario: No todos hides main and footer sections
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer section is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Create a new todo by pressing Enter
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item with the title "Buy milk"
+    And the new-todo input is cleared
+
+  Scenario: Trimming whitespace from new todo title
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    When I type "   Walk the dog   " into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item with the title "Walk the dog"
+
+  Scenario: Empty todo is not created
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    When I type "" into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Show the active todo count
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    And I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    And I mark the first todo as completed
+    Then the todo count shows "1 item left"
+    And the count number is wrapped in a <strong> tag
+
+  Scenario: Pluralize item count correctly
+    Given the app has loaded with no persisted todos
+    When I create a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo count shows "1 item left"
+    When I create a todo titled "Walk the dog"
+    Then the todo count shows "2 items left"
